      "title": "11. Comparing against today's bank rules",
      "description": "`threshold_baseline` is what a basic bank system does: flag every transfer of ₹10,000 or more, or 10+ transfers a day.\n\n`evaluate` measures **precision** (of what we flagged, how much was really laundering) and **recall** (of all laundering, how much we caught).\n\n**SAY:** \"We always compare against the simple rule, so our numbers mean something.\""
    },
