      "title": "12. Backend: FastAPI server",
      "description": "When the server starts, it loads the transactions and runs the detection engine **once** (lines 38 and 39), then keeps the alerts in memory so the website is fast.\n\nEvery line starting with `@app.get` or `@app.post` below is a web address the frontend calls.\n\n**SAY:** \"The backend is FastAPI. It runs our engine once at startup and serves alerts, money trails and reports to the website through an API.\""
    },
