      },
      "title": "13. Case actions and the audit trail",
      "description": "When an investigator changes a status, adds a note or freezes an account, this function saves it, and **every change is written to an audit log** with who did it and when (lines 247 to 262).\n\n**SAY:** \"Regulators require a record of every decision. Each action is logged with the analyst's name and time, and saved to disk.\""
    },
