      },
      "title": "14. Follow the money",
      "description": "Behind the **Follow money** button. From any account, follow where the money went next (or came from), up to 4 hops, keeping only transfers that carry a real share of the amount.\n\n**SAY:** \"From any suspicious account, the investigator can follow the money further than the original alert to find the rest of the network.\""
    },
