      "title": "15. Frontend: drawing the money trail",
      "description": "The browser side. `drawGraph` uses the **Cytoscape.js** library to draw the accounts and arrows you see in the app, coloured by role (collector, depositor, mule).\n\n**SAY:** \"The frontend is plain JavaScript. It only displays what the backend sends; all detection happens on the server.\""
