        }
      },
      "title": "ML 4. The model: Random Forest",
      "description": "`make_model` is a **Random Forest**: 300 decision trees, each trained on a random sample, that vote. `class_weight` balances the rare laundering cases. The threshold is chosen on the validation weeks.\n\n**Click to train and test it (about 30 seconds):**\n\n>> .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python src/train_model.py\n\n**SAY:** \"On the unseen month: threshold rules F1 0.26, our graph rules 0.46, ML alone 0.80, and the hybrid 0.88. The hybrid catches 53 of 55 laundering schemes and wrongly flags 0 of 91 genuine look-alikes, where the rules alone flagged 39.\""
    },
