      "title": "ML 5. The model inside the app",
      "description": "When the server starts it loads the trained model, scores every transfer, and gives every alert a **verdict**: *Likely laundering* or *Likely genuine* (lines 67 to 80).\n\n**SAY:** \"Every alert in the workspace now carries the hybrid model's verdict, so investigators look at real cases first.\""
    },
