      "title": "20. Automatic tests",
      "description": "Each test builds a tiny case by hand, for example 12 people each sending ₹9,500 to one account, and checks the right detector fires. Other tests check look alikes that should **not** fire.\n\n**Click the command to run all 21 tests:**\n\n>> .\\.venv\\Scripts\\python -m pytest tests -v\n\n**SAY:** \"We have 21 automatic tests covering every detector, the ML model and the backend. All pass.\""
    },
